<title>SWEDEN: Alfred Berg brokers 3.3 mln SAS shares at 97 SKR.</title>
<headline>Alfred Berg brokers 3.3 mln SAS shares at 97 SKR.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Alfred Berg brokered a block of 3.33 million shares in Scandinavian airline SAS at 97 crowns a piece on Wednesday.</p>
<p>SAS share rose on the news, rising to 95 crowns from 93 crowns before the announcement and from Tuesday's close of 92 crowns.</p>
<p>According the DN owernship service, this block was equivalent to about 4.7 percent of votes and capital in SAS.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
